  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "ChalkQL.Sources 0.5 updates source integrations for ChalkQL 0.5, including standing-view change tracking and revised source/runtime contracts.\n\n      - **POCO tables**: Now track keyed updates, deletes and supported compactions as row-level changes. Keyed refreshes and index appends are substantially more efficient, with pooled row storage reducing allocations. Index lookups are faster, and string ordering is consistent across CLR strings and UTF-8.\n      - **Licence:** Changed to Elastic License 2.0 (ELv2). See the README for permitted-use details.\n      \n      Requires exactly ChalkQL 0.5.0.\n\n      Full release notes:\n      https://github.com/markhammond/chalkql/releases/tag/v0.5",
